,"url":"/cli-reference/eval-command#eval-score","content":"Exit zero on suite failure"},"591":{"id":"/cli-reference/eval-command-114","page_id":"/cli-reference/eval-command","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/cli-reference/eval-command#eval-scorecard","content":"Folds many runs into named metrics and gates each on its own threshold, where `eval report` describes one run and `eval score` decides one run's verdict."},"592":{"id":"/cli-reference/eval-command-115","page_id":"/cli-reference/eval-command","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/cli-reference/eval-command#eval-scorecard","content":"A scorecard reports each measurement's own rate rather than a suite pass rate. A case carrying both a skill-invocation check and a tool-call ceiling would otherwise report a budget overrun as a recall failure."},"593":{"id":"/cli-reference/eval-command-116","page_id":"/cli-reference/eval-command","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/cli-reference/eval-command#eval-scorecard","content":"Option"},"594":{"id":"/cli-reference/eval-command-117","page_id":"/cli-reference/eval-command","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/cli-reference/eval-command#eval-scorecard","content":"Description"},"595":{"id":"/cli-reference/eval-command-118","page_id":"/cli-reference/eval-command","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/cli-reference/eval-command#eval-scorecard","content":"`--root <DIR>`"},"596":{"id":"/cli-reference/eval-command-119","page_id":"/cli-reference/eval-command","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/cli-reference/eval-command#eval-scorecard","content":"**Required unless `--from`.** Searched recursively for run directories (any directory holding a `summary.json`)"},"597":{"id":"/cli-reference/eval-command-120","page_id":"/cli-reference/eval-command","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/cli-reference/eval-command#eval-scorecard","content":"`--metrics <FILE>`"},"598":{"id":"/cli-reference/eval-command-121","page_id":"/cli-reference/eval-command","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/cli-reference/eval-command#eval-scorecard","con