sion-controls","content":"An exact target can be a deliberate downgrade. `patch` stays within the current major/minor,\n`minor` stays within the current major, and `latest`/`major` use the recorded constraint. An exact\npin is never widened implicitly."},"1848":{"id":"/cli-reference/update-command-58","page_id":"/cli-reference/update-command","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/cli-reference/update-command#global-updates","content":"Global JSON uses the same lifecycle keys as project JSON: `scope`, `outcome`, `dry_run`, `targets`,\n`diagnostics`, `resolution`, and `indexing`. A missing global lock returns an unchanged document\nwith explicit skipped-indexing diagnostics rather than `null` lifecycle fields."},"1849":{"id":"/cli-reference/update-command-59","page_id":"/cli-reference/update-command","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/cli-reference/update-command#failure-and-recovery","content":"Before mutation, fastskill verifies selected managed content and refuses to replace local edits.\nEach affected closure is staged and validated. A failed application restores its prior files and\nstate, reports the failed target, and exits nonzero."},"1850":{"id":"/cli-reference/update-command-60","page_id":"/cli-reference/update-command","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/cli-reference/update-command#see-also","content":"Project install."},"1851":{"id":"/cli-reference/update-command-61","page_id":"/cli-reference/update-command","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/cli-reference/update-command#see-also","content":"Skill and project commands."},"1852":{"id":"/cli-reference/update-command-62","page_id":"/cli-reference/update-command","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/cli-reference/update-command#see-also","content":"Reconciliation."},"1853":{"id":"/configuration/init-command","page_id":"/configuration/init-command","type":"page","content":"Init Command","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Manage skills","Project configuration"],"tags":[],"url":"/configuration/init-command"},"1854":{"id":"/configuration/init-co