e-also","content":"See also"},"2097":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-17","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#eval-setup","content":"This page is the reference for **authoring** an eval suite: the config table in `skill-project.toml`, the prompts CSV a suite is made of, and the optional checks TOML that actually decides pass/fail. Work through it top to bottom once, then use Run evals for the day-to-day commands."},"2098":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-18","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#eval-setup","content":"For guided suite design, use the FastSkill skill.\nIts eval-authoring workflow\nand copyable invoice example are maintained and packaged in the skills repository."},"2099":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-19","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#prerequisites","content":"`skill-project.toml` exists (project root or skill directory — `fastskill` walks up the tree to find it)."},"2100":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-20","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#prerequisites","content":"`SKILL.md` exists alongside it if you're authoring a single skill's suite."},"2101":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-21","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#prerequisites","content":"For `fastskill eval run`: a supported agent CLI on `PATH`. Agent keys come from aikit-sdk: `aikit`, `claude`, `codex`, `cursor`, `gemini`, and `pi`. A key is accepted only when its CLI is detected on the current machine; a typo and an uninstalled agent both error with `RUNTIME_UNKNOWN_ID`. `fastskill eval validate --all` reports which keys are detected in *your* environment."},"2102":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-22","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#prerequisites","content":"Deterministic validation and scoring need no model credential. Target execution needs the\nselected runtime's authentication; native judges separately need their configured endpoint,\nmodel, and credential environment variable. Embedding configuration is unrelated."},"2103":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-23","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#1-the-toolfastskilleval-table","content":"Add this table to `skill-project.toml`. Every path is resolved relative to the **skill project root** (the directory containing `skill-project.toml`) unless it's absolute."},"2104":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-24","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#1-the-toolfastskilleval-table","content":"Field"},"2105":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-25","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#1-the-toolfastskilleval-table","content":"Type"},"2106":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-26","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#1-the-toolfastskilleval-table","content":"Required"},"2107":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-27","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#1-the-toolfastskilleval-table","content":"Default"},"2108":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-28","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#1-the-toolfastskilleval-table","content":"Meaning"},"2109":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-29","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#1-the-toolfastskilleval-table","content":"`prompts`"},"2110":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-30","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#1-the-toolfastskilleval-table","content":"path"},"2111":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-31","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#1-the-toolfastskilleval-table","content":"**yes**"},"2112":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-32","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#1-the-toolfastskilleval-table","content":"—"},"2113":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-33","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#1-the-toolfastskilleval-table","content":"Path to the prompts CSV."},"2114":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-34","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#1-the-toolfastskilleval-table","content":"`checks`"},"2115":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-35","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#1-the-toolfastskilleval-table","content":"path"},"2116":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-36","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#1-the-toolfastskilleval-table","content":"no"},"2117":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-37","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#1-the-toolfastskilleval-table","content":"none"},"2118":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-38","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#1-the-toolfastskilleval-table","content":"Path to the checks TOML. Even when omitted, `should_trigger` produces a per-case trigger expectation — see the callout below."},"2119":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-39","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#1-the-toolfastskilleval-table","content":"`timeout_seconds`"},"2120":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-40","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#1-the-toolfastskilleval-table","content":"integer"},"2121":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-41","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#1-the-toolfastskilleval-table","content":"no"},"2122":{"id":"/evals-quality/setup-42","page_id":"/evals-quality/setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/evals-quality/setup#1-the-toolfastskilleval-table","content":