text","url":"/registry/index-system#directory-naming","content":"The directory structure is derived from the skill ID (scope/id format):"},"2850":{"id":"/registry/index-system-22","page_id":"/registry/index-system","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/registry/index-system#directory-naming","content":"**Scope** → First directory level (the publishing organization, e.g., \"acme\")"},"2851":{"id":"/registry/index-system-23","page_id":"/registry/index-system","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/registry/index-system#directory-naming","content":"**ID** → Second directory level (the package name, must not contain slashes, e.g., \"web-scraper\")"},"2852":{"id":"/registry/index-system-24","page_id":"/registry/index-system","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/registry/index-system#directory-naming","content":"Examples:"},"2853":{"id":"/registry/index-system-25","page_id":"/registry/index-system","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/registry/index-system#directory-naming","content":"`acme/web-scraper` → `acme/web-scraper/` (scope: \"acme\", id: \"web-scraper\")"},"2854":{"id":"/registry/index-system-26","page_id":"/registry/index-system","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/registry/index-system#directory-naming","content":"`myorg/analytics-tool` → `myorg/analytics-tool/` (scope: \"myorg\", id: \"analytics-tool\")"},"2855":{"id":"/registry/index-system-27","page_id":"/registry/index-system","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/registry/index-system#directory-naming","content":"`john/personal-helper` → `john/personal-helper/` (scope: \"john\", id: \"personal-helper\")"},"2856":{"id":"/registry/index-system-28","page_id":"/registry/index-system","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/registry/index-system#directory-naming","content":"This structure:"},"2857":{"id":"/registry/index-system-29","page_id":"/registry/index-system","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/registry/index-system#directory-naming","content":"Groups skills by organization"},"2858":{"id":"/registry/index-system-30","page_id":"/registry/index-syste