":"/registry/marketplace-json-137","page_id":"/registry/marketplace-json","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/registry/marketplace-json#metadata-priority","content":"Supplement SKILL.md metadata with additional fields in skill-project.toml"},"3036":{"id":"/registry/marketplace-json-138","page_id":"/registry/marketplace-json","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/registry/marketplace-json#metadata-priority","content":"Maintain version control separately from SKILL.md content"},"3037":{"id":"/registry/marketplace-json-139","page_id":"/registry/marketplace-json","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/registry/marketplace-json#metadata-priority","content":"**Example**: If skill-project.toml has `version = \"2.0.0\"` but SKILL.md has `version: \"1.0.0\"`, the marketplace.json will use `\"2.0.0\"`. Similarly, if skill-project.toml has `author = \"New Author\"`, it will override the author from SKILL.md. The `name` field always comes from SKILL.md frontmatter for display purposes, as it is not present in skill-project.toml."},"3038":{"id":"/registry/marketplace-json-140","page_id":"/registry/marketplace-json","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/registry/marketplace-json#validation","content":"The registry validates `marketplace.json` files:"},"3039":{"id":"/registry/marketplace-json-141","page_id":"/registry/marketplace-json","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/registry/marketplace-json#validation","content":"All required fields must be present"},"3040":{"id":"/registry/marketplace-json-142","page_id":"/registry/marketplace-json","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/registry/marketplace-json#validation","content":"`id`, `name`, and `description` must not be empty"},"3041":{"id":"/registry/marketplace-json-143","page_id":"/registry/marketplace-json","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/registry/marketplace-json#validation","content":"Skills with invalid data are skipped"},"3042":{"id":"/registry/marketplace-json-144","page_id":"/registry/marketplace-json","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/registry/marketplace-