ustom tools inside FastSkill — instead, `fastskill mcp serve` exposes FastSkill CLI commands\nto an agent as MCP tools, and `fastskill mcp install` writes the server config into your agent's\nconfiguration."},"3317":{"id":"/tool-calling/development-9","page_id":"/tool-calling/development","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/tool-calling/development#overview","content":"The server is **read-only by default**: the mutating commands are not exported as tools unless you\nstart it with `--enable-write`. See Write access below."},"3318":{"id":"/tool-calling/development-10","page_id":"/tool-calling/development","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/tool-calling/development#serve-fastskill-as-an-mcp-server","content":"Each exported CLI command is registered as an MCP tool named `fastskill_<path>`, where the command\npath has its separators replaced by underscores. For example:"},"3319":{"id":"/tool-calling/development-11","page_id":"/tool-calling/development","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/tool-calling/development#serve-fastskill-as-an-mcp-server","content":"CLI command"},"3320":{"id":"/tool-calling/development-12","page_id":"/tool-calling/development","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/tool-calling/development#serve-fastskill-as-an-mcp-server","content":"MCP tool name"},"3321":{"id":"/tool-calling/development-13","page_id":"/tool-calling/development","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/tool-calling/development#serve-fastskill-as-an-mcp-server","content":"`fastskill skill search`"},"3322":{"id":"/tool-calling/development-14","page_id":"/tool-calling/development","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/tool-calling/development#serve-fastskill-as-an-mcp-server","content":"`fastskill_skill_search`"},"3323":{"id":"/tool-calling/development-15","page_id":"/tool-calling/development","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/tool-calling/development#serve-fastskill-as-an-mcp-server","content":"`fastskill repo add`"},"3324":{"id":"/tool-calling/development-16","page_id":"/tool-calling/development","tags":[],"type":